# Production Example: Customer Support Agent

## Architecture

```
POST /api/chat  ──▶  ChatController
                        │
                  SupportAgentService
                        │
              CompiledGraph (LangGraph4j AgentExecutor)
              ┌─────────┴──────────┐
              │  agent (LLM node)  │◀──┐  ReAct loop
              │  action (tools)    │───┘
              └─────────┬──────────┘
                        │ checkpoints (threadId = userId:conversationId)
                  PostgresSaver ──▶ PostgreSQL
```

